msgstr ""
"Specifică un receptor Pulseaudio care nu este implicit pentru fluxul audio."

#. type: IP
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-tumbleweed
